{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"title":"Consent","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L42"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/NegativeHeldRecordLimit"],"generated":true,"title":"Consent","anchor":"Consent"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates it as the user decides:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event is gated by its type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":", by the decisions made before it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Granted:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Undecided:"}]},{"text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},{"text":". The hold keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at most ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"heldRecordLimit"},{"text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends first.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Denied:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it records the status, which ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker reports its own drops.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"i